  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decolonization and Depatriarchalization of Education for Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen individual and collective agency to implement an intercultural gender perspective in URACCAN that challenges colonial and patriarchal heritages which underpin violence and discrimination in the Caribbean Coast. The project will promote the empowerment of multi-ethnic women and other marginalized groups, and dialogue arenas between the university and surrounding community with a view to promote change in behaviour and governance improvement in URACCAN.</narrative>
  </description>
